<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πωρ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶρος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>petrify</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος πεπωρωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					10.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cause a stone</i> or <i>callus to form</i>:—
				Pass.
			, of <i>a stone forming</i> in the bladder, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unite fractured bones by a callus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				47
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.70
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become hard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				802b8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.15.2
			</span></i>; <i>become thickened, coagulated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				222
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, <i>become insensible</i>, of the flesh, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῆς πεπωρωμένης ἐκ τοῦ στέατος
					σαρκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nymphis
					16
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>become insensible, obtuse</i>, or
			<i>blind</i>, of the heart, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				6.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				11.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπώρωνται γὰρ ἀπὸ ὀργῆς οἱ
					ὀφθαλμοί μου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jb.</u>
					17.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
